########################################
# Unity 6
########################################

# Dossiers temporaires Unity
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
UserSettings/
CrashReport/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
.utmp/

# Cache Unity
# GI / Lightmapping
**/Lightmap-*/
**/LightProbes.asset
**/ReflectionProbe-*.exr
**/GICache/

# Shader cache
**/ShaderCache/
**/*.shadercache

# Addressables
Assets/StreamingAssets/aa.meta
Assets/StreamingAssets/aa/*
Assets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# Package Manager
.npm/
Packages/com.unity.package-manager-ui/*

# XR / VR
**/XRDeviceLogs/
**/XR/Generated/
# Oculus
Assets/Plugins/Oculus/Tools/Spatializer/*
Oculus/Avatar2/Build/*
# OpenXR cache
**/OpenXR/FeatureSupportCache/

# Multiplayer/Netcode (NGO/Transport caches)
**/NetCodeGenerated/**
**/SnapshotDataCache/**


